From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agrucza <a.grucza@gmx.net>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 15:46:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2731/2733] dt-bindings: display: panel: samsung,atna33xc20:
 add ATNA33AA08

Add the Samsung ATNA33AA08-0, the 13.3" 3K eDP AMOLED panel of the ASUS
ProArt PZ13 (EDID vendor SDC, product 0x41b0). It is handled by the
atna33xc20 driver like the other panels of this family.

Signed-off-by: agrucza <a.grucza@gmx.net>
Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/display/panel/samsung,atna33xc20.yaml   | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/samsung,atna33xc20.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/samsung,atna33xc20.yaml
index 82c30c5..f175a3a 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/samsung,atna33xc20.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/samsung,atna33xc20.yaml
@@ -21,6 +21,8 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               # Samsung 13" 3K (2880×1920 pixels) eDP AMOLED panel
               - samsung,atna30dw01
+              # Samsung 13.3" 3K (2880x1800 pixels) eDP AMOLED panel
+              - samsung,atna33aa08
               # Samsung 14" FHD+ (1920x1200 pixels) eDP AMOLED panel
               - samsung,atna40ct06
               # Samsung 14" WQXGA+ (2880x1800 pixels) eDP AMOLED panel
